{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28429","headline":"湖南正初招李郢秀才 · 杜牧","name":"湖南正初招李郢秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行乐及时时已晚，对酒当歌歌不成。\n千里暮山重叠翠，一溪寒水浅深情。\n高人以饮爲忙事，浮世除诗尽强名。\n看着白苹芽欲吐，雪舟相访胜闲行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}